{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39913","headline":"茘枝二首 二 · 徐夤","name":"茘枝二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日日薰风卷瘴烟，南园珍菓茘枝先。\n灵鸦啄破琼津滴，宝器盛来蚌腹圆。\n锦里只闻销醉客，蘂宫惟合赠神仙。\n何人刺出[猩猩]血，深染罗纹遍壳鲜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39913.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39913","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}